<h2>What's New</h2>
<ul>
    <li>The bar's collapse control no longer draws an outline, a lighter fill, or a top highlight. It sits flat on the bar and shows only a subtle wash on hover.</li>
    <li>The collapse chevron and app icon are smaller, so both sit just under the size of the bar's labels instead of dominating them.</li>
    <li>Added a smoke-test gate that verifies the tests, signature, notarization ticket, checksum, and signed appcast before a release publishes.</li></ul>
<p class="footer">DockishOS 0.025</p>
